    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i have a huge presentation coming up tomorrow and im getting super nervous. my hands are shaking and my heart is racing really fast like crazy. i have some propranolol from a friend, would it be okay if i took a pill to help with the jitters and heart racing so i can focus? i do have asthma though so i wanted to check first.",
